1
00:01:48,576 --> 00:01:50,576


2
00:02:25,055 --> 00:02:25,955
It's the ghost ship!

3
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,173
A ghost ship appeared?

4
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,278
That makes five ships sunk already.

5
00:03:01,875 --> 00:03:03,700
What on earth is that ghost ship?

6
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:07,152
Well, according to a surviving sailor,

7
00:03:07,176 --> 00:03:09,880
the one controlling the ghost ship was...

8
00:03:10,970 --> 00:03:12,120
Wh-Who was it?

9
00:03:13,475 --> 00:03:15,993
They say it's the notorious Blood.

10
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:17,313
Blood?

11
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,540
<i>That Blood...?</i> Surely there must be some mistake!

12
00:03:21,190 --> 00:03:23,980
There are eyewitnesses who saw him clearly.

13
00:03:26,394 --> 00:03:30,440
So, there's no doubt the ghost ship is Blood's doing, right?

14
00:03:31,140 --> 00:03:33,380
No, there is no mistake.

15
00:03:36,616 --> 00:03:38,480
I just can't believe it.

16
00:03:39,113 --> 00:03:41,106
Blood saved me so many times.

17
00:03:58,450 --> 00:04:01,946
He's rough-spoken, but I thought he was a kind person...

18
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:05,840
Sapphire!

19
00:04:05,925 --> 00:04:08,520
What's wrong? She seems so down.

20
00:04:08,951 --> 00:04:10,105
All right!

21
00:04:10,940 --> 00:04:13,260
What's wrong? What were you thinking about?

22
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,731
Oh, u-uh, it's nothing!

23
00:04:16,262 --> 00:04:17,582
Hold on tight, we're speeding up!

24
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,420
Wow, look at all those ships!

25
00:04:51,410 --> 00:04:52,405
That must be the ship.

26
00:04:52,429 --> 00:04:53,246
What?

27
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,900
Uh-oh, this is bad! They found us!

28
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,279
Is anyone here?

29
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:37,820
Blood!

30
00:05:38,900 --> 00:05:40,060
Hey, Sapphire.

31
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,360
I knew it was your ship, Blood.

32
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:46,440
But lounging around without posting a lookout is dangerous.

33
00:05:48,330 --> 00:05:51,220
Without a lookout? Take a look behind you.

34
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,880
Are you alright?

35
00:06:08,820 --> 00:06:11,440
I'm fine, I just lost my footing.

36
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:22,500
The decoy plan was a success, wasn't it?

37
00:06:22,850 --> 00:06:25,660
As if I'd let them uncover our secret so easily.

38
00:06:26,205 --> 00:06:30,470
Exactly. Once that plan succeeds, Silverland will...

39
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:36,339
This is no laughing matter, Blood!

40
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:37,971
Back off, Sapphire.

41
00:06:37,996 --> 00:06:39,598
If we were a ghost ship,

42
00:06:39,622 --> 00:06:42,320
there's no way we'd openly sail right into your port, would we?

43
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,486
Besides, there are plenty of servants.

44
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:48,758
Even as we speak, the army might come to capture you.

45
00:06:48,782 --> 00:06:50,080
No need to worry about that, though.

46
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,580
Look.

47
00:06:55,496 --> 00:06:56,742
Wait for me!

48
00:07:01,446 --> 00:07:03,966
Unbelievable... When on earth did this happen?

49
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,300
Hey, lower the boat for them!

50
00:07:07,486 --> 00:07:08,266
A boat?

51
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:11,246
Get the sturdiest boat so we can reach the harbor safely.

52
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:13,960
Wait, Blood. I'm not going back.

53
00:07:15,380 --> 00:07:17,472
If we defeat the ghost ship with this vessel,

54
00:07:17,496 --> 00:07:19,280
we can prove your innocence too.

55
00:07:20,115 --> 00:07:21,051
Not a chance.

56
00:07:21,075 --> 00:07:22,398
The sea is a man's world.

57
00:07:22,422 --> 00:07:24,344
 Women only defile it.

58
00:07:24,369 --> 00:07:25,053
Right, boys?

59
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:26,220
That's right!

60
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,005
You're just trying to cover yourself!

61
00:07:29,029 --> 00:07:30,220
I am never going back!

62
00:07:30,810 --> 00:07:31,900
When I tell you to leave, leave!

63
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,533
When I say I'm not going back, I'm not going back!

64
00:07:35,530 --> 00:07:36,565
Got it, Sapphire.

65
00:07:36,589 --> 00:07:39,600
Just don't come whining about it later.

66
00:07:39,905 --> 00:07:40,865
Leave it to me!

67
00:07:40,889 --> 00:07:43,140
I won't lose to anyone when it comes to work on a ship.

68
00:07:43,670 --> 00:07:44,545
You hear that, boys?

69
00:07:44,569 --> 00:07:45,652
Don't hold back!

70
00:07:45,676 --> 00:07:46,945
Work him hard!

71
00:07:46,969 --> 00:07:47,760
Real hard!

72
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,220
Yeah!

73
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:55,520
Alright, rookie, get to work! First up, laundry!

74
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,546
Of course! When that's done, we raise a toast!

75
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,826
No time to sit around. What's next?

76
00:08:03,050 --> 00:08:05,013
Make the special, then polish the mast!

77
00:08:08,876 --> 00:08:11,125
Hey! Hyah! Hyah!

78
00:08:11,949 --> 00:08:14,149
Get out of the way!

79
00:08:17,250 --> 00:08:19,126
What should I do next, Gramps?

80
00:08:19,465 --> 00:08:21,086
Polish the mast!

81
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,500
All right!

82
00:08:45,239 --> 00:08:47,408
Captain, I can't compete with him!

83
00:08:47,439 --> 00:08:50,648
He cooks every day and pulls a full workload.

84
00:08:50,672 --> 00:08:55,706
That's for sure. And I've never seen such an attentive deckhand.

85
00:09:14,149 --> 00:09:16,288
All I see is ocean.

86
00:09:16,312 --> 00:09:18,660
Silverland is so far away now.

87
00:09:30,976 --> 00:09:34,300
Father, Mother... I wonder how you're doing right now.

88
00:09:34,899 --> 00:09:37,220
I'm sure they're worrying about you since you're not there.

89
00:09:39,219 --> 00:09:40,215
You did great out there.

90
00:09:40,592 --> 00:09:42,180
Looks like everyone has a new respect for you.

91
00:09:42,319 --> 00:09:42,948
How rude!

92
00:09:42,972 --> 00:09:44,593
Barging in without knocking!

93
00:09:45,609 --> 00:09:49,100
I did knock. You were just daydreaming and didn't notice.

94
00:09:49,895 --> 00:09:53,239
Instead of worrying about me, why don't you go find that ghost ship?

95
00:09:54,439 --> 00:09:55,155
We will.

96
00:09:56,139 --> 00:09:59,173
We'll track it down and teach them a sailor's lesson.

97
00:09:59,529 --> 00:10:00,468
Leave it to me!

98
00:10:01,406 --> 00:10:02,766
A ghost ship!

99
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:04,933
Blood!

100
00:10:17,769 --> 00:10:19,528
Blood, if we bring the ship closer...

101
00:10:19,552 --> 00:10:21,988
Wait, that's dangerous! We should scout in a boat...

102
00:10:22,012 --> 00:10:26,393
All right, lower the boats! Captain Blood here will take you sightseeing on a ghost ship!

103
00:10:26,795 --> 00:10:29,479
Lower away!

104
00:10:45,819 --> 00:10:46,492
I'm scared!

105
00:10:47,189 --> 00:10:47,848
Don't be afraid.

106
00:10:47,872 --> 00:10:49,715
That's just St. Elmo's fire.

107
00:10:49,739 --> 00:10:51,720
It's just atmospheric electricity clinging to the mast.

108
00:10:59,075 --> 00:11:00,340
Is anyone here?

109
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:04,000
If no one's there, answer me!

110
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:08,140
Anything unusual?

111
00:11:08,235 --> 00:11:09,235
N-No, sir.

112
00:11:09,685 --> 00:11:12,160
Looks like this was just a shipwreck after all.

113
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,233
Hey, everyone! Pull back!

114
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:16,500
Hooray!

115
00:11:16,569 --> 00:11:17,766
What a letdown.

116
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:31,033
What's this?

117
00:11:33,611 --> 00:11:35,019
How scary!

118
00:11:41,055 --> 00:11:43,086
I-I-It's disgusting!

119
00:11:52,619 --> 00:11:54,380
Fancy meeting you in a place like this.

120
00:11:58,113 --> 00:11:59,319
Y-You...

121
00:11:59,837 --> 00:12:01,726
That's right, I'm a fake sailor!

122
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:03,906
Now that you've discovered the secret down here in the hold,

123
00:12:03,931 --> 00:12:05,953
I can't just let you leave in one piece!

124
00:12:06,343 --> 00:12:06,873
Show yourselves!

125
00:12:14,506 --> 00:12:16,126
You can't go back now.

126
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:19,019
You're coming to our home, Hell Island!

127
00:12:19,043 --> 00:12:20,886
That's right Hell Island!

128
00:12:25,973 --> 00:12:27,473
Tink!

129
00:12:28,090 --> 00:12:30,346
Hurry up, or I'll leave you behind!

130
00:12:35,250 --> 00:12:37,726
Um, Bosun, have you seen Tink?

131
00:12:38,969 --> 00:12:41,800
Well, couldn't he be on that boat that left earlier?

132
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,893
We checked everywhere, but he wasn't there.

133
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:47,980
Good work. Alright, pull back.

134
00:13:02,979 --> 00:13:03,932
Damn it!

135
00:13:04,232 --> 00:13:04,912
We've been set up!

136
00:13:04,992 --> 00:13:05,985
Blast it!

137
00:13:08,112 --> 00:13:08,959
Look out! Incoming!

138
00:13:30,339 --> 00:13:32,526
Set the sails! Hard to port!

139
00:13:40,919 --> 00:13:42,400
Prepare to attack!

140
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:45,820
Gunners, take aim!

141
00:14:04,923 --> 00:14:05,789
Gramps!

142
00:14:07,403 --> 00:14:10,045
Put an end to this once and for all, Sapphire.

143
00:14:10,069 --> 00:14:12,729
The ghost ship... destroy the ghost ship...

144
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:17,670
Blood...

145
00:14:19,659 --> 00:14:20,546
Damn it!

146
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:32,820
Blood, amazing!

147
00:14:33,489 --> 00:14:36,133
Captain! The ghost ship is getting away!

148
00:14:36,569 --> 00:14:37,660
Pursue it at once!

149
00:14:45,810 --> 00:14:47,940
I'll pay you back double for this!

150
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:49,480
Count on it!

151
00:15:17,359 --> 00:15:20,560
Here's that rum you loved so much. Giving you the good stuff.

152
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,180
Goodbye, Gramps!

153
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,240
Still no sign of the ghost ship?

154
00:15:47,499 --> 00:15:49,906
No, sir. Just a seagull flying around.

155
00:15:55,465 --> 00:15:56,465
A letter...

156
00:16:00,819 --> 00:16:04,673
<i>I got captured by the ghost ship.</i>

157
00:16:06,346 --> 00:16:11,173
And I was brought to an island called Hell Island.

158
00:16:12,695 --> 00:16:15,820
This place is truly terrifying.

159
00:16:16,995 --> 00:16:22,280
There are so many guards, even a shark couldn't get close.

160
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:44,073
Alright! Test the ghost battery!

161
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:52,715
Stay away from this cove.

162
00:16:53,466 --> 00:16:56,326
Please deliver this letter to Sapphire.

163
00:16:57,139 --> 00:16:58,002
Hell Island?

164
00:16:58,026 --> 00:16:59,620
Is that their base?

165
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:00,620
You know it?

166
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:01,589
Of course.

167
00:17:01,613 --> 00:17:03,549
There's only one cove ships can enter,

168
00:17:03,573 --> 00:17:05,182
and the rest is surrounded by cliffs.

169
00:17:05,206 --> 00:17:06,960
A perfect hideout for villains.

170
00:17:08,269 --> 00:17:10,846
And you're framing me for the ghost ship just because I know that?

171
00:17:11,909 --> 00:17:13,619
Wait! There's something else written here!

172
00:17:13,854 --> 00:17:16,079
What? The bosun is a spy?

173
00:17:26,539 --> 00:17:28,140
Thanks to you, I will live to see another day.

174
00:17:29,949 --> 00:17:31,155
Hell Island is a volcanic island.

175
00:17:31,606 --> 00:17:33,422
The surrounding sea is boiling from the heat.

176
00:17:33,859 --> 00:17:35,240
The back of the island is a massive cliff.

177
00:17:35,724 --> 00:17:36,995
We'll land from there.

178
00:17:37,473 --> 00:17:39,800
We won't win this fight unless we outsmart them.

179
00:17:40,339 --> 00:17:41,760
Got it, everyone?

180
00:17:59,159 --> 00:18:01,740
Whoa, watch out! Hold onto me, alright?

181
00:18:09,239 --> 00:18:10,080
Follow me!

182
00:18:24,569 --> 00:18:26,133
Sapphire! Don't look down!

183
00:18:29,393 --> 00:18:30,625
Guards!

184
00:18:31,109 --> 00:18:32,660
Stay quiet so they don't spot us!

185
00:18:59,349 --> 00:19:04,100
Thanks to your cooperation, the Ghost Ship Plan is progressing steadily.

186
00:19:04,869 --> 00:19:07,325
Tonight, let's celebrate the bright future of Grand Duke Duralumin,

187
00:19:07,350 --> 00:19:09,245
who carried out this plan!

188
00:19:09,689 --> 00:19:12,720
Party hard, everyone!

189
00:19:22,354 --> 00:19:23,965
A party in the Haunted Hall?

190
00:19:24,262 --> 00:19:26,300
I'll send every last one of you straight to hell!

191
00:19:39,403 --> 00:19:40,639
Get him!

192
00:20:01,981 --> 00:20:02,981
Look at them fly!

193
00:20:04,939 --> 00:20:07,120
I'll handle these guys! Don't let him get away!

194
00:20:20,369 --> 00:20:21,560
I'll show 'em!

195
00:20:44,079 --> 00:20:46,008
The boss was beaten! Run!

196
00:20:46,912 --> 00:20:48,679
Don't back down! Get them!

197
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:02,480
Blood! It's a huge victory! We won!

198
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:04,960
Blood?

199
00:21:06,449 --> 00:21:11,420
You finally did it? This completely clears me of suspicion.

200
00:21:12,469 --> 00:21:13,990
Hold on, Blood!

201
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:16,073
Sapphire!

202
00:21:19,613 --> 00:21:20,765
Are you alright?

203
00:21:20,989 --> 00:21:25,300
Tink, thanks to your letter, we avenged everyone. You did great.

204
00:21:25,554 --> 00:21:27,809
But Blood, are you okay?

205
00:21:27,913 --> 00:21:29,146
No need to worry.

206
00:21:30,389 --> 00:21:32,020
I'm invincible.

207
00:21:52,986 --> 00:21:53,405
Go home.

208
00:21:53,729 --> 00:21:54,696
Go home right away.

209
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:58,600
My men will take you back on the ghost ship we captured.

210
00:21:59,869 --> 00:22:03,229
But Blood, I'm still worried about your injuries!

211
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:06,320
As you can see, I'm perfectly fine!

212
00:22:06,719 --> 00:22:08,322
You need to hurry back home and

213
00:22:08,346 --> 00:22:12,620
crush the villains' next evil plans! Got it?

214
00:22:14,496 --> 00:22:15,700
Now hurry up and go!

215
00:22:17,293 --> 00:22:18,293
Blood!

216
00:22:19,569 --> 00:22:21,556
He got terribly hurt for my sake...

217
00:22:22,647 --> 00:22:23,781
Will he really be okay?

218
00:22:29,979 --> 00:22:31,513
Set sail!

219
00:22:35,666 --> 00:22:36,909
Way to go!

220
00:22:36,933 --> 00:22:38,826
Quite a swordsman, isn't she?

221
00:22:41,514 --> 00:22:43,160
Are you alright, Captain?

222
00:22:43,364 --> 00:22:44,460
Bah, this is nothing!

223
00:22:48,579 --> 00:22:50,840
Goodbye.

224
00:22:58,899 --> 00:23:01,220
He's gruff and stubborn, but...

225
00:23:02,399 --> 00:23:03,440
...kind Captain Blood.

226
00:23:05,697 --> 00:23:07,697

